ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡Por fin es el Día del Pavo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Estoy irreconocible, ¡llevo toda la
mañana cocinando!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ay,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} qué ganas de terminar ya
y de pasar a la acción{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I'm actually a pretty good cook!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Does that surprise you?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} The trick is
to hum to yourself while you work!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Sono una cuoca niente male, eh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
La cosa ti sorprende?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Il segreto
sta nel canticchiare mentre mescoli!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hohoho!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'd been thinking of a lot
of different menu items for today.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
It's nice to see them turn out!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hi hi !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} J'ai réussi tous les plats que
j'comptais préparer pour la fête !{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Youhou !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ohohohoh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ho pensato a un sacco
di portate diverse per oggi.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Non è male vederle pronte!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hohoho{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}! Bugün için türlü türlü
yemek düşünmüştüm. Hepsinin{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ortaya çıkmasını görmek güzel!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}C'est la fête des récoltes,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} le jour où
ceux qui croient savoir cuisiner{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
cherchent à l'prouver !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Today's the town {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Harvest Festival{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It's the one time of year when it's
OK to stuff yourself silly!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Oggi è la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Festa d'autunno{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
È l'unico giorno dell'anno in cui
la regola è... riempirsi la pancia!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bu yılki Hasat{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} Festivali'nde{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}
Franklin{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} bayağı gergin
görünüyordu!{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Ama olsun, değil{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
mi? Seneye yine dener!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Cedrone{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} mi è sembrato molto
nervoso durante questa
Festa d'autunno!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Ma, ehi, ha fatto del suo meglio!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}L'antipasto non era male, eh!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Pendant la fête des récoltes,
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Dindou {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}avait vraiment l'air furax,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mais t'as fait d'ton mieux, nan ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
En tout cas, la soupe était top !

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Menudo artista está hecho el
cocinero, ¿eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Cosa fina!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Yo repetí como dos o tres veces{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Puede que incluso cuatro, ejem.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}¡Estaba todo de rechupete!

{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Lo mejor para una {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}ensalada mixta{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
con muchos ingredientes {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}es echarle
un poquitín de {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}vinagre{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Si le echas otro aliño,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} puedes
cargarte toda la ensalada...{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
¡Tenlo en cuenta, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Also, {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Pilzcremesuppe{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} ohne {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Butter{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
ist wie 'ne Party ohne mich!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Das geht gaaar nüscht!

{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Also, {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Muschelcremesuppe{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} ohne
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Butter {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}ist wie 'ne Party ohne mich!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Das geht auf keine Kuhhaut!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Tra tutte le minestre che ci sono
al mondo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} quella di {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}frutta{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
è insuperabile per me!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Per farla, serve frutta fresca{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
e una spruzzata di {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}limone{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} per finire!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Quando si è stanchi, un po'
di minestra di frutta fresca fa
sentire come nuovi! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Haste schon mal {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Obstsuppe{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
probiert? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich find die ja total
klasse!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}So frisches {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Obst{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} und {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Zitrone{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} is'
schon was Feines! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Sollteste machen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0000:0002:4B00}}Wink mit dem Zaunpfahl!{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}

{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Weißte, wie Fisch am besten
schmeckt?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wenn du ihn in der
Pfanne brätst! 
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Oder wenn du ihn dämpfst!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Und dann noch 'ne leckere Soße
dazu{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
Und zum Schluss noch etwas {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Essig  {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
oder {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Zitrone{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} drüber und gut is'!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Das krieg selbst ich noch hin!

